# Sealed reading

Pre-specified (docs/NORMAN_PLAN.md section 5). Metric pearson_delta per sealed perturbation, paired. Reading rule, pooled and in every category: a gain counts when it exceeds twice its paired standard error and the better side wins on more than half the perturbations; a category with fewer than 10 sealed perturbations is reported, not read. The tool made 4 sealed scorings on oracles of its own, outside the runs' caps; 1 of the compared models had never been scored on the sealed set and are scored here for the first time (norman_g0_ds_w4_r3:EXP_0007); every other one was scored when its run ended. Wins are counted per perturbation; the visible and out-of-fold rows pair the same models on the visible validation perturbations and, out of fold, the training ones. Tool code 2f2e683.

